Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.24,0:00:11.11,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,Brother, isn't he...?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.11,0:00:14.24,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,The one from Resembool.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.51,0:00:18.18,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,Hey! Are you the one who wrecked this village?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.18,0:00:21.95,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,{\fs29}Were you planning to do the same to Resembool?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.95,0:00:23.95,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,What's your aim?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.95,0:00:26.46,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,What did you make with that transmutation circle?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.46,0:00:29.12,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,I had a feeling we would meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.12,0:00:32.43,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,You rascal. Stop talking nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.87,0:00:38.50,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.17,0:00:44.44,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,You're also... a young alchemist.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.16,0:01:06.40,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,You have the same eyes as I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.46,0:01:09.40,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.04,0:01:17.34,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,You have no right to stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.81,0:01:24.85,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0.6\c&HFFEFF5&\alpha&H10&}Crowley!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.85,0:01:26.35,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0.6\c&HFFEFF5&\alpha&H10&\t(0,830,\bord1\c&HFFFFFF&)}Crowley!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.35,0:01:28.45,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,It's Crowley, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.45,0:01:31.69,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,It has to be you. I knew it, it's Crowley!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.69,0:01:35.22,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,Don't you recognize me? It's me, Arlen!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.22,0:01:36.43,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,Crowley!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.15,0:01:39.19,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,Crowley...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.19,0:01:41.40,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,Wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.40,0:01:45.43,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,The Arlen I know is not an old man like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.43,0:01:48.04,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,What are you saying? Of course I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.04,0:01:57.28,Serifa Std,,0,0,1,,{\fs22.5}How many decades do you think have passed since then? \NYou're the one who's wrong! What on earth happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.05,0:01:59.95,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,Crowley!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.93,0:02:15.36,Serifa Std,,0,0,1,,{\fs22.5}There he goes again...\NHe melted away and disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.87,0:02:24.01,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,Looks like it’s over now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.01,0:02:28.14,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,{\fs27.8}Pull yourself together, Lieutenant Havoc. Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.14,0:02:30.05,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,No, I'm not okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.05,0:02:35.38,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,Could you tell the Colonel to double my hazard pay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.38,0:02:39.79,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,I wasn't told this site would be so dangerous.
